flowchart TD

  %% Entry points - three ways a specific session gets touched
  RSVP[Attendee RSVPs to\none specific session] --> LOOKUP
  COMMENT[Attendee comments on\none specific session] --> LOOKUP
  OVERRIDE[Organizer overrides time/\nlocation/description, or cancels] --> LOOKUP

  LOOKUP{EventOccurrence row\nexists for this event+date?}
  LOOKUP -->|yes| EXISTING[Use existing row]
  LOOKUP -->|no| VALIDATE{Date is a real\noccurrence per\nRecurrence#schedule?}
  VALIDATE -->|no| REJECT[Reject - not a real\nsession of this series]
  VALIDATE -->|yes| CREATE[find_or_create_occurrence_for date\ncreates EventOccurrence row]

  CREATE --> EXISTING
  EXISTING --> ATTACH{What triggered this?}

  ATTACH -->|RSVP| ATT[EventAttendance\nevent_occurrence_id set\nseries-wide attendance untouched]
  ATTACH -->|Comment| CMT[Comment via Commentable\ncommentable = EventOccurrence]
  ATTACH -->|Override| OVR[Set starts_at/ends_at/location/\ndescription_override or cancelled]

  OVR --> SYNC[after_commit: refresh parent\nEvent#next_occurrence_at\nif this is the nearest occurrence]

  %% Authorization - delegates to parent, never duplicates hosts
  ATTACH -.->|every write path| AUTHZ[EventOccurrencePolicy\ndelegates to record.event.event_hosts\nvia shared EventHostAuthorizable concern\nNO EventHost duplication]

  %% Read path - the other 95%+ of occurrences that were never touched
  subgraph READ [Read path - most occurrences never get a row]
    INDEX[Events index] --> NOA["Event.next_occurrence_at\n(SQL column, hourly-refreshed)"]
    CAL[Calendar grid] --> EXPAND["CalendarOccurrenceExpander\nRecurrence#occurrences_between window"]
    EXPAND --> MERGE{EventOccurrence exists\nfor this computed date?}
    MERGE -->|yes| EFFECTIVE["Use effective_starts_at / effective_location /\neffective_description, show cancelled badge"]
    MERGE -->|no| VIRTUAL["Purely virtual Occurrence PORO\nno row created just by viewing"]
  end

  EXISTING -.->|read-only lookup, no write| MERGE

  classDef entry fill:#e3f2fd
  classDef decision fill:#fff3e0
  classDef write fill:#ffebee
  classDef read fill:#e8f5e8
  classDef authz fill:#f3e5f5

  class RSVP,COMMENT,OVERRIDE entry
  class LOOKUP,VALIDATE,ATTACH,MERGE decision
  class CREATE,EXISTING,ATT,CMT,OVR,SYNC,REJECT write
  class INDEX,CAL,NOA,EXPAND,EFFECTIVE,VIRTUAL read
  class AUTHZ authz
